      'shweta-builders', '05', 'Shweta', 'Shweta — Works — Captionz',
      'Shweta approached us for their project Shweta Aryan, located in an area that was not a hot destination for the construction industry.', 'Builders & Developers', 'Builders &amp; Developers', 'branding',
      '15 pieces', 1, 'https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/bc1002e11a_d76625_b9977774f1d54e0cadfa0003e4eeb9a8_.jpg', NULL,
      'Shweta approached us for their project Shweta Aryan, located in an area that was not a hot destination for the construction industry.', 0, NULL, NULL,
      NULL, '[]', NULL,
      '["Shweta approached us for their project Shweta Aryan, located in an area that was not a hot destination for the construction industry.","With the help of extensive print media and an area-focused outdoor campaign, Shweta Aryan not just sold out the first block but also built two more blocks — and the complete project was sold out.","With Shweta Aryan&#x27;s success, the Kompally area is today getting recognition for various construction projects and the value of the area has increased."]', '[{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/bc1002e11a_d76625_b9977774f1d54e0cadfa0003e4eeb9a8_.jpg","alt":"Shweta — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7c095a2cca_d76625_b9977774f1d54e0cadfa0003e4eeb9a8_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/4ed969484b_d76625_96d199efdfe14d72963034c4f63ddb51_.jpg","alt":"Shweta — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/9b3f462bdd_d76625_96d199efdfe14d72963034c4f63ddb51_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/94c9e9bbae_d76625_813781cf94ce43f2a9fcf02b129d118b_.jpg","alt":"Shweta — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/d1b2a453fd_d76625_813781cf94ce43f2a9fcf02b129d118b_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/c1a251e8b2_d76625_c25c1d275cac464dbbd3703461bde358_.jpg","alt":"Shweta — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/abc335cff5_d76625_c25c1d275cac464dbbd3703461bde358_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/a1b9680da0_d76625_6a10a3eb75a54b718a1f1592242e4f2a_.jpg","alt":"Shweta — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7fddbd6d00_d76625_6a10a3eb75a54b718a1f1592242e4f2a_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/3b1e6ac219_d76625_73c42e449f484506