      'bradsol', '06', 'Bradsol', 'Bradsol — Works — Captionz',
      'Bradsol was swimming in an area of ITES where it had innumerable competition from small and medium level companies. The job was to make Bradsol stand ', 'IT Services', 'IT Services', 'branding',
