      'packaging', '08', 'Packaging', 'Packaging — Works — Captionz',
      'While the end users enjoy the purchase, it&#x27;s the packaging that adds to the style and attitude.', 'Printing & Packaging', 'Printing &amp; Packaging', 'print',
      '23 pieces', 1, 'https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7ac4e89756_d76625_1f750d1357eb457b907fc275dbeb0b70_.jpg', NULL,
      'While the end users enjoy the purchase, it''s the packaging that adds to the style and attitude.', 0, NULL, NULL,
      NULL, '[]', NULL,
      '["While the end users enjoy the purchase, it&#x27;s the packaging that adds to the style and attitude.","In today&#x27;s world packaging matters — it elevates expectation and, to some extent, status. Captionz helps clients make this end-user shopping experience as desirable as possible.","Innovative invitations, greetings and gifting solutions are also taken care of."]', '[{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7ac4e89756_d76625_1f750d1357eb457b907fc275dbeb0b70_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/3cb8ab33f6_d76625_1f750d1357eb457b907fc275dbeb0b70_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7111e36a91_d76625_f09fe1462b344ad3a211deec678cd7db_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/755dd02995_d76625_f09fe1462b344ad3a211deec678cd7db_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/c657369598_d76625_893cc4200da7496786a2b8d1c780a25f_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/f19a7cc462_d76625_893cc4200da7496786a2b8d1c780a25f_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/f038bd1f24_d76625_21d9db7620a340b8abda0581808ba27f_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/de09541319_d76625_21d9db7620a340b8abda0581808ba27f_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/0abee5a2a7_d76625_9c68b484a7ac4c64beecb534e18eafd5_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/7d87428a55_d76625_9c68b484a7ac4c64beecb534e18eafd5_.jpg"},{"src":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/6323752e17_d76625_f241c7fa1277488faf50a9effdd178f9_.jpg","alt":"Packaging — work by Captionz","hi":"https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8