      'exhibitions', '09', 'Exhibitions', 'Exhibitions — Works — Captionz',
      'Exhibitions are an integral part of any marketing plan. Making our stall attract attention is our goal.', 'Event Planning', 'Event Planning', 'events',
      '25 pieces', 1, 'https://pub-97c17fb137b447f6a52871a6328a8f1a.r2.dev/works/9ed7f1459a_d76625_89f97886d9394485b2ba08b26e3237d3_.jpg', NULL,
      'Exhibitions are an integral part of any marketing plan. Making our stall attract attention is our goal.', 0, NULL, NULL,
      NULL, '[]', NULL,
